<BaseLayout title="About BrewTested" description="BrewTested is an independent coffee and kitchen gear review site. We research products so you buy right the first time.">
  <article class="prose prose-amber max-w-none">
    <h1>About BrewTested</h1>
    <p>BrewTested is an independent review site covering coffee makers, grinders, espresso machines, and kitchen gear. We exist because buying coffee equipment is confusing — brands overpromise, prices vary wildly, and most "reviews" are just product descriptions.</p>
    <h2>How We Research</h2>
    <p>We don't claim to physically test every product. Instead, we do what a thorough buyer would: we study specs, dig through owner reviews on Amazon and Reddit, cross-reference common failure points, compare manufacturer claims to real-world feedback, and synthesize that into honest recommendations.</p>
    <p>When we say "we tested" in older posts, we mean we researched thoroughly — spec analysis, owner feedback patterns, and expert community input. We're updating our language across the site to make this clearer.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>BrewTested participates in the Amazon Associates program and other affiliate programs. If you buy through our links, we earn a small commission — at no extra cost to you. This is how we keep the site free. Our recommendations are based on research quality, not commission rates.</p>
    <h2>Research Methodology</h2>
    <p>For a detailed explanation of how we select products, categorize complaints, and assign confidence ratings, see our <a href="/methodology/">research methodology page</a>. Our structured datasets are also available for inspection: <a href="/data/espresso-setup-matrix/">espresso setup matrix</a> and <a href="/data/coffee-gear-complaint-index/">complaint index</a>.</p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>We maintain a public <a href="/corrections/">corrections and update log</a>. If you spot a factual error, outdated price, or wrong product detail, email <a href="mailto:paulet4a5@gmail.com">paulet4a5@gmail.com</a> and we'll review and update within 7 days.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions or corrections? Email us at <a href="mailto:paulet4a5@gmail.com">paulet4a5@gmail.com</a>. If you spot a wrong ASIN, outdated price, or inaccurate product detail, please let us know — we want to fix it.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
